#: ../../site/troubleshooting.md:1
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../site/troubleshooting.md:3
msgid "Configure or build fails"
msgstr "配置或构建失败"

#: ../../site/troubleshooting.md:5
msgid ""
"Confirm that the C++ toolchain supports C++23, CMake is at least 3.25, and "
"the pinned submodules are present (`git submodule update --init --"
"recursive`). If a consumer-provided DataFrame is used, set "
"`FINCORE_DATAFRAME_SOURCE_DIR` or provide a discoverable `DataFrameConfig."
"cmake`."
msgstr ""
"确认 C++ 工具链支持 C++23、CMake 版本至少为 3.25，并且固定版本的子模块已就位"
"（`git submodule update --init --recursive`）。如果使用方提供了 DataFrame，请"
"设置 `FINCORE_DATAFRAME_SOURCE_DIR`，或提供可被发现的 `DataFrameConfig."
"cmake`。"

#: ../../site/troubleshooting.md:10
msgid "Tests fail on a platform"
msgstr "测试在某个平台上失败"

#: ../../site/troubleshooting.md:12
msgid ""
"Record the compiler, standard flags, CMake generator and the exact failing "
"test. Do not weaken assertions or change numerical tolerances merely to make "
"a local platform pass. The acceptance record distinguishes qualified passes "
"and external blockers."
msgstr ""
"记录编译器、标准标志、CMake 生成器以及具体失败的测试。不要仅仅为了让本地平台"
"通过就弱化断言或修改数值容差。验收记录会区分合格通过与外部阻塞。"

#: ../../site/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "Data or numerical errors"
msgstr "数据或数值错误"

#: ../../site/troubleshooting.md:19
msgid ""
"Check units, index timezone/order/uniqueness, missing values, duplicate "
"keys, ties and window warm-up against the specific API contract. A `NaN` "
"result may mean an incomplete window or a genuinely undefined statistic, not "
"zero return."
msgstr ""
"对照具体 API 契约，检查单位、索引时区/顺序/唯一性、缺失值、重复键、并列值以及"
"窗口预热期。`NaN` 结果可能表示窗口不完整或统计量确实未定义，而不是零收益率。"

#: ../../site/troubleshooting.md:23
msgid "Documentation build fails"
msgstr "文档构建失败"

#: ../../site/troubleshooting.md:25
msgid ""
"Run Doxygen first, then Sphinx with `-W -n --keep-going`; confirm Doxygen "
"XML was regenerated from the same commit. Missing Breathe XML, stale gettext "
"catalogs and external link outages are separate failure classes; do not hide "
"them with global warning suppression."
msgstr ""
"先运行 Doxygen，再以 `-W -n --keep-going` 运行 Sphinx；确认 Doxygen XML 是从"
"同一提交重新生成的。缺少 Breathe XML、gettext 消息目录过期以及外部链接不可用"
"属于不同的故障类别；不要通过全局抑制警告来掩盖它们。"
